# Private-namespace members and their homes, one "DICT /name" per line.
# The dict-homes test asserts every pair still appears in data/*.ps: a
# member may gain company but may not move home or vanish. A feature
# that adds a member appends it here in the same commit, so the file
# is the running register of where interpreter machinery lives.
